{
  "tema": 6062,
  "slug": "aquel-aquella-lejos",
  "titulo": "That, those (over there): aquel, aquella",
  "subtitulo": "«Aquella casa azul es de mis abuelos.»",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Aquel, aquella, aquellos, aquellas mean that / those (over there): something far from both the speaker and the listener, in space or in time. They go before the noun and agree with it.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Use **aquel** for things far from both of you, usually **allá**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "",
            "singular",
            "plural"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "masculine",
              "aquel carro",
              "aquellos carros"
            ],
            [
              "feminine",
              "aquella casa",
              "aquellas casas"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The masculine singular is **aquel**: no **-o**. (**Aquello** is a neuter pronoun and never goes before a noun.)"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Time works the same way: **aquel** día, **aquellos** años, **aquella** vez = the distant past."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Aquella== casa azul es de mis abuelos.",
              "en": "That blue house over there is my grandparents'."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Aquel== señor de la gorra es mi entrenador.",
              "en": "That man over there in the cap is my coach."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Aquellos== cerros se ven verdes después de la lluvia.",
              "en": "Those hills over there look green after the rain."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Quiénes son ==aquellas== muchachas de allá?",
              "en": "Who are those girls over there?"
            },
            {
              "es": "==Aquellas== olas allá afuera están perfectas.",
              "en": "Those waves out there are perfect."
            },
            {
              "es": "En ==aquella== época no había internet.",
              "en": "Back in those days there was no internet."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Te acuerdas de ==aquel== día en Rosarito?",
              "en": "Do you remember that day in Rosarito?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
